; max 40 tips right now!! (Was 20, jacked up by MK on August 5, 1999.  Search for MAX_PLAYER_TIPS to change.)

+Tip: XSTR("Use your manuvering thrusters, they may save your life in a dogfight.", 1438)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [R] to target a ship that's attacking you.", 1439)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [Alt-H] to enable auto-targeting of hostile ships. Press [Alt-H] again to disable.", 1440)
+Tip: XSTR("Attacking the weapons subsystem of a capital ship reduces the accuracy of its turrets. Press [S] to target subsystems.", 1441)
+Tip: XSTR("You may sometimes call in reinforcements by pressing [C] then [4]. This will lower your score, however.", 1442)
+Tip: XSTR("Countermeasures can protect you from incoming missiles, but only if the missiles are very close.", 1443)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [Shift-/] to link your secondary weapons together. Press [.] to cycle between primary weapons.", 1444)
+Tip: XSTR("Target bombs by pressing [B]. When you destroy them, stay clear of the shockwave.", 1445)
+Tip: XSTR("If the game's too easy or too hard for you, change the skill level in the Options Menu (press [F2])", 1446)
+Tip: XSTR("If you fail a mission, click on 'Recommendations' in the debriefing for tips.", 1447)
+Tip: XSTR("If you have fired a nuclear warhead at a target, keep a safe distance from the point of impact.", 1448)
+Tip: XSTR("If you fire bombs when you're too far from your target, they may get shot down.", 1449)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [G] to target the nearest ship or turret attacking your target. This is an effective way to protect against large ships.", 1450)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [Alt-M] to enable auto-speed matching. This automatically matches your speed to that of your target. Press [Alt-M] again to disable it.", 1451)
+Tip: XSTR("Before firing an aspect-seeking missile, such as the HD-70 Lightning Javelin, you must first gain lock on your target.", 1452)
+Tip: XSTR("To link your primary weapons, press [.] twice. Your kinetic energy weapons will inflict more damage but you will go through more ammo.", 1453)
+Tip: XSTR("When attacking large ships, it is vital to take out turrets. Target them by pressing [K].", 1454)
+Tip: XSTR("If gameplay is choppy, lower your detail settings in the Options Menu (press [F2]).", 1455)
+Tip: XSTR("During a mission, you can view all messages by pressing [F4] and choosing the 'Messages' button.", 1456)
+Tip: XSTR("If you leave a mission early, you'll get in trouble. Wait for orders to jump out or land.", 1457)
+Tip: XSTR("If you want more kills, tell your wingmen to 'Ignore My Target' in the communications menu (press [C]).", 1458)
+Tip: XSTR("Nukes appear on DRADIS but conventional bombs do not. You can target both nukes and conventional bombs by pressing [B].", 1459)
+Tip: XSTR("When firing missiles with a high reload time, you can switch to another bank to fire more rapidly.", 1460)
+Tip: XSTR("Remember that some ships such as the Heavy Raider do not have afterburners.", 1461)
+Tip: XSTR("If you're out of countermeasures, you can sometimes avoid a missile by turning away from it and hitting your afterburners at the last moment.", 1462)
+Tip: XSTR("Flying ahead of your wingmen into a battle can be very dangerous. Sometimes it's safest to order them in ahead of you.", 1463)
+Tip: XSTR("Some ships blow up with very large shockwaves. Get clear quickly to avoid severe damage.", 1464)
+Tip: XSTR("Press [F1] anywhere to get context-sensitive help.", 1465)
+Tip: XSTR("Glide mode [W] can be used for strafing runs on capital ships.", 1466)
+Tip: XSTR("If your mission is to protect other ships, go after enemies armed with nukes first.", 1467)
+Tip: XSTR("In multiplayer missions, press [1] to send a message to all players.", 1468)
+Tip: XSTR("In team vs. team missions, press [2] to send a message to just your team.", 1469)
+Tip: XSTR("In team vs. team missions, press [3] to send a message to the other team.", 1470)
+Tip: XSTR("In multiplayer missions, press [4] to send a message to your target.", 1471)
+Tip: XSTR("Communicating with your wingmen is a key to winning tough missions.", 1472)
+Tip: XSTR("When attacking a capital ship, concentrate on one section. Once the turrets and flak cannons in that section have been destroyed, bombing runs will be much easier.", 1473)
+Tip: XSTR("In case a mission is just too tough, you'll be given a chance to skip it after five failed attempts.", 1474)

#end
